# agents/.gitignore
#
# ALLOWLIST. Everything in this directory is ignored by default; only the
# generic templates shipped with sammy-pack are un-ignored below. Any agent
# set imported from a consumer app (domain-specific, per-machine, per-dev) is
# excluded automatically — so a stray `git add -A` can never commit it to the
# public repo. To ship a NEW generic template, add an explicit `!name.md`.
#
# Same principle as credentials.json: ship templates, not imported artifacts.
# See agents/README.md for the per-machine import workflow.

*
